WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.064
Welcome to Module 10 Reshaping Data in PostgreSQL
Reshaping

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:11.711
changes structure not the underlying facts We will
move between long

00:00:11.724 --> 00:00:17.566
and wide forms pivot categories into columns unpivot
columns back into rows preserve meaningful

00:00:17.592 --> 00:00:23.338
NULL values and protect the intended analytical
grain The most important

00:00:23.364 --> 00:00:27.404
habit in this module is to say what one output row
represents before you write

00:00:27.417 --> 00:00:28.509
the reshape query
